0U) >> 8) & ~38U` nibble correction is exercised exhaustively (all 256 single-byte and all 65536 two-byte inputs).\n\n## Artifacts\n\n`translation/`: `SYMBOLS.md`, `ERRORS.md`, `CONFIGS.md`, `run_all.sh` (builds C, diffs symbols, loops all feature combos × profiles), `tests/common/mod.rs`, `tests/differential.rs`, `tests/error_paths.rs` (fork-based, since the error surface is `abort()`). Both libraries are always loaded via `libloading`; no Rust function is called directly.\n\nTwo notes: `cargo` needs `--offline` here (crates.io is proxy-blocked; `libloading-0.8.9` was in the local cache), and `run_all.sh` takes ~9 min because the huge-`bin_len` fault rows must walk memory until they hit an unmapped page."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3264,"cache_read_input_tokens":69552,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3264,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"24cfdf76-de3a-44a8-ac84-719f360b110e","uuid":"e6a0c31b-8772-40d8-9dfa-c2c9579a39cb","timestamp":"2026-09-05T00:05:42.033Z"}
